{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udca7<strong> YOU MOVE, YOU MELT </strong>\ud83d\udca7</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a cute, jiggly slime, every move makes you melt. Whether you\u2019re giant or tiny, you must cleverly manage your weight. Each size uniquely affects your speed, health, resistance, and ability to interact with specific objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/2db6fefe8ab7ab1eb9528d350e8e21ae.poster.avif?t=1767927206\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/2db6fefe8ab7ab1eb9528d350e8e21ae.webm?t=1767927206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/2db6fefe8ab7ab1eb9528d350e8e21ae.mp4?t=1767927206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd25<strong>BRAVE THROUGH DANGER\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udd25</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Conquer 100% handcrafted levels filled with dangerous traps and fast-paced precision platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/3f47f8c392d322dcb782622bf091b2b4.poster.avif?t=1767927206\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/3f47f8c392d322dcb782622bf091b2b4.webm?t=1767927206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/3f47f8c392d322dcb782622bf091b2b4.mp4?t=1767927206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udde9\u00a0<strong>SOLVE\u00a0BRAIN-TEASING PUZZLES\u00a0</strong>\ud83e\udde9</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Not every trial is about speed, some will test your mind with clever trials to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/d161a16664fc711c7921cb3505f19723.poster.avif?t=1767927206\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/d161a16664fc711c7921cb3505f19723.webm?t=1767927206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/d161a16664fc711c7921cb3505f19723.mp4?t=1767927206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfa8\u00a0<strong>CLAIM YOUR COLORS\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfa8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Uncover multiple secret colors and reward your exploration with new ways to customize your slime\u2019s style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/48523eac117a77e739244875f1cc60ad.poster.avif?t=1767927206\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/48523eac117a77e739244875f1cc60ad.webm?t=1767927206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/48523eac117a77e739244875f1cc60ad.mp4?t=1767927206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span